AQQv46A0sX_QAXkzToF5ekfJ6s2IHXnNlul--psxMVkmdg&oe=6AFDC0B7"}, {"file_name": "ed roland.png", "id": "1047067571263658", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312454_1047067574596991_3545592460762382153_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o5xL_MbUQLUQ7kNvwG5ITQg&_nc_oc=Adp1RCcj24xqDQ7GPwC7MnlSy5tUWlECbUHTSWQabUIIu7CGibUVlSbAFq0B61PXaiM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRysU600aXwCJpQCxMpH0Ll4GYgOR4IQ6TDh7hq7YMmMA&oe=6AFDAFC7"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1592824024803033", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974593_1592824028136366_2785707857221777252_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OPUMS2lSaK0Q7kNvwHZXVjP&_nc_oc=Adov3Nhu8HPXc-tQ6791batConyZW2ODttOxI51h6xPwesRtt65Th-DZkXKO0va2Ec0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSU_13JTqepFyh3JM7QRP0YqNY_EaKLnmUVAtBhXbo3PQ&oe=6AFDD1D7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "splash_16-9.png", "id": "1819072665376918", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828816_1819072668710251_7353430703769565817_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z2xgOQRP2PUQ7kNvwGsuXb6&_nc_oc=Adq99Ujz84deyfPfVXRNfxLJDK3lGlmZbpUog-mxyU5QUjYEDAUHGFcdR4QnNZhWxlo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTP3KtcT0pD2YM0KKA4DhczS0uRPWTLRZjRsk49AYopxg&oe=6AFDC8CF"}, "display_name": "Soapbox - Live Performers In Your House", "keywords": ["hologram", "comedy", "music", "lineup", "concert"], "long_description": "Soapbox puts life-size holograms of real musicians and comedians in your living room. Walk around them. They are volumetric captures of the actual people - not avatars, not CGI, not 360 video.\n\nBuild an Instant House Show: pick a lineup, queue performances back to back, and watch them appear in mixed reality (passthrough, in your room) or in a full VR venue.\n\nThe catalog includes T-Pain, Buddy Guy, Yelawolf, Soulja Boy, Jim Jones, Waka Flocka Flame, Norma Jean, Tank, and more. Plus stand-up you can put in the same lineup.\n\nFree to download and explore. Unlock premier performances with one-off purchases or a monthly or yearly subscription.\n\nSoapbox is the only way to have your favorite artists appear life-size in your space.", "short_description": "New users get 3 days free!\n\nLife-size holograms of real musicians and comedians in your living room. Build an Instant House Show: pick a lineup, queue performances, and watch them appear in mixed reality or a full VR venue. No avatars - volumetric captures of the actual artists. \n\nFree to download, with a catalog you can explore."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "splash_portrait.png", "id": "1770420413866405", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827063_1770420417199738_9163659578469219972_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NSl0gk7iPV8Q7kNvwEJbx2S&_nc_oc=AdodavltVRP2dCUIcWevBWLWeT31E52G5FoUyLwINMwwCqdsnox1KBoTQMmPT6At8jI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSWjluwavWyEeNRSA4uD1axha6gIGqw91hgz9H-BH7bcA&oe=6AFDD235"}, {"file_name": "splash_square.png", "id": "1433199797716384", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300910_1433199801049717_1165102973676556133_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3nK8GCD8UEMQ7kNvwGny8yw&_nc_oc=AdphE-XyXxNv5V6kkAkCo32tdLCh4UQNQRrhebAtsUoZv7H3rJDgrcHCEUqDqIZRvPg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSjqlAZoOQq29eX_P_WzWfrLHFuI9fEEbMjZI4aoI3XKA&oe=6AFDCB85"}, {"file_name": "meta banner.png", "id": "1408416804241288", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305071_1408416807574621_5283805827554035897_n.png?_nc_ca